Label":"马瑞辰","sectionLabel":"按","text":"序曰：「關雎，后妃之德也。」瑞辰案，序以關雎為后妃之德，而下云「所以風天下而正夫婦」。正謂詩所稱淑女為后妃，非謂后妃求賢也。首章毛傳云：「后妃說樂君子之德無不和諧，不淫其色，慎固幽深，若關雎之有別焉。」又言：「后妃有關雎之德，是幽閒貞靜之善女，宜為君子之好匹。」皆以淑女指后妃。二章傳云：「后妃有關雎之德，乃能共荇菜，備庶物，以事宗廟。」三章傳云：「后妃喜君子無傷善之樂。」亦謂后妃德盛耳，未嘗有后妃求賢之說也。后妃求賢之說，始於鄭箋誤會詩序「憂在進賢」一語為后妃求賢，不知序所謂進賢者，亦進后妃之賢耳。孔疏不悟序及毛傳與箋異義，概以后妃求賢釋之，誤矣。","notes":"依据页图转写。"}]},"siblings":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"layerLabel":"篇序","title":"關雎后妃之德也","href":"/shijing/gloss/001-guan-ju/maruichen-tongshi/0001-1","isCurrent":true},{"id":"0002","order":2,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"關關雎鳩","href":"/shijing/gloss/001-guan-ju/maruichen-tongshi/0002-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0003","order":3,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"在河之洲","href":"/shijing/gloss/001-guan-ju/maruichen-tongshi/0003-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0004","order":4,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"窈窕淑女","href":"/shijing/gloss/001-guan-ju/maruichen-tongshi/0004-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0005","order":5,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"君子好逑","href":"/shijing/gloss/001-guan-ju/maruichen-tongshi/0005-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0006","order":6,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"參差荇菜","href":"/shijing/gloss/001-guan-ju/maruichen-tongshi/0006-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0007","order":7,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"左右流之","href":"/shijing/gloss/001-guan-ju/maruichen-tongshi/0007-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0008","order":8,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"寤寐求之","href":"/shijing/gloss/001-guan-ju/maruichen-tongshi/0008-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0009","order":9,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"寤寐思服","href":"/shijing/gloss/001-guan-ju/maruichen-tongshi/0009-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0010","order":10,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"輾轉反側","href":"/shijing/gloss/001-guan-ju/maruichen-tongshi/0010-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0011","order":11,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"琴瑟友之","href":"/shijing/gloss/001-guan-ju/maruichen-tongshi/0011-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0012","order":12,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"鐘鼓樂之","href":"/shijing/gloss/001-guan-ju/maruichen-tongshi/0012-1","isCurre